// Axiom Compiler — Precompiled .axmeta/Binary Package Consumption Engine &
// Multi-Repository Routing / Namespace Pinning Defender (`compiler/pkg/distribution/mod.ax`, T860 / E20.3).
//
// Implements SPEC-112 §§1..4 (`AXS-REG-020`..`023`, `AXS-REG-031`, `AXS-REG-050`;
// `REQ-ECO-8736`, `REQ-PKG-024`, `REQ-PKG-010`, `INV-REG-002`, `INV-DET-001`).

